+  /** Matches a term-level quote pattern's `body` (e.g. `StringContext(${Varargs(Exprs(parts))}: _*)`)
+   *  against an `Expr[?]` scrutinee structurally. `body` is the
+   *  pre-`QuotePatterns`-phase shape tree: ordinary term structure
+   *  (`Apply`/`Select`/`Ident`/`Typed`) with real `SplicePattern` nodes
+   *  wherever the source wrote `${pattern}` -- walk both trees in
+   *  parallel, and at each `SplicePattern` hand off to the ordinary
+   *  `matchPattern`/`UnApply` machinery (which already knows how to
+   *  destructure `Varargs`/`Exprs`/etc, added above) using the
+   *  corresponding scrutinee sub-tree (wrapped as a fresh `Expr`) as its
+   *  scrutinee.
