+        // actually being run here is frequently declared on an ANCESTOR of
+        // `inst.cls` (e.g. `PartialFunction#lift`'s own hand-written
+        // shortcut below calls into a `Seq`'s `isDefinedAt` override, whose
+        // real body -- declared on `SeqOps`, not the concrete `ofRef`/etc
+        // class -- references `SeqOps.this`). Binding only the concrete
+        // class leaves every ancestor `This` unresolved.
+        val withParams = bindThis(params.zip(args).foldLeft(emptyEnv)((e, pv) => e.updated(pv._1, pv._2)), inst.cls, inst)
